l be defeated.)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961310/extras/98da098e3ecabf0ddf9d723770b4483d.avif?t=1731641924\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>*Control<br>Basically, you use the mouse to operate before entering the stage.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961310/extras/31f5142362a9ff81befb7c1ba38855e9.avif?t=1731641924\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>*Character Movement<br>Basically, it is operated using the arrow keys or WASD.<br>(You can change the movement keys in settings.)<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2961310/extras/ba174d50265ec96169c3e70f28de11e1.avif?t=1731641924\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br>[Game characteristics]<br>* There are six female characters in the story.<br>* Solving puzzles corresponding to each character yields peculiar illustrations.",
